      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i need some help or maybe just to talk through something bc im kinda freaking out. i was doing that internship at the lab last month and there was that leak in the containment unit... the one they didnt report? i think i definitely caught some of that particle stream. since then i've been seeing these weird colors in my peripheral vision. like if something bad is about to happen i see these heavy red clouds hanging in the air but then if things are gonna go well it's like these bright blue streaks. i thought i was just losing it but then i saw the red clouds right before that fender bender on the highway today. is there any scientific way this is actually happening??",
